# Architecture Rules

1. Keep LangGraph orchestration, A2A inter-agent communication and MCP tool/data access conceptually separate.
2. Domain agents and intelligence specialist agents are different axes; do not duplicate specialist roles per domain without a strong reason.
3. Persist `mission_lead` and `active_specialist` separately.
4. Prefer deterministic services for metrics, statistics, ML, causal inference and optimization.
5. No business-data direct connector may bypass the governed MCP/data gateway in production code.
6. New agent capabilities must be added to the registry and have versioned contracts/tests.
7. Do not introduce autonomous write actions in the intelligence milestone.
